            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.14

- Fixed manual and scheduled update checks by giving each Sparkle check a fresh, cache-busting GitHub Release feed URL.
- Prevents GitHub’s CDN from returning an earlier appcast immediately after a release is published.
]]></description>
