            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.12

- Corrected the volume HUD’s Liquid Glass composition by moving the native glass effect to the popover’s root view, where macOS can render it dynamically.
- Removed the redundant flat blur beneath the volume controls and retained the fast reveal and return animation.
]]></description>
